### Using the information to solve

Let's plug $\blueD{l_1'(t_0)}=\blueD{-5}$, $\maroonD{l_2(t_0)}=\maroonD{9}$, $\goldD{l_1(t_0)}=\goldD{3}$, and $\purpleC{l_2'(t_0)}=\purpleC{14}$ into the expression for $A'(t_0)$:

$\begin{align}
A'(t_0)&=\dfrac{\blueD{l_1'(t_0)}\maroonD{l_2(t_0)}+\goldD{l_1(t_0)}\purpleC{l_2'(t_0)}}{2}
\\\\
&=\dfrac{(\blueD{-5})(\maroonD{9})+(\goldD{3})(\purpleC{14})}{2}
\\\\
&=-1.5
\end{align}$
